  "Aggregates Booking, Expedia, Hotels.com and more, sorted by price.": ["Reúne Booking, Expedia, Hotels.com y otros, ordenado por precio.", "Reúne Booking, Expedia, Hotels.com e outros, ordenado por preço.", "يجمع Booking وExpedia وHotels.com وغيرها، مرتّبًا حسب السعر.", "Riunisce Booking, Expedia, Hotels.com e altri, ordinati per prezzo.", "Bündelt Booking, Expedia, Hotels.com und weitere, nach Preis sortiert."],
